cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the article (preferred-citation) and this package."
type: software
title: "Comparing six LiDAR-based simultaneous localisation and mapping approaches on public orchard datasets to assess the feasibility of GNSS-free autonomous machinery"
abstract: "Code, frozen configurations and evaluation outputs (per-run and aggregated results, run diagnostics and resource logs) of a scripted benchmark of six LiDAR SLAM methods (hdl Graph SLAM, LeGO-LOAM, A-LOAM, DLO, KISS-ICP, SLAMesh) on the CitrusFarm and Pullally orchard datasets."
version: "1.0.0"
